# ==============================================================================
# Office to PDF (PPTX / DOCX / XLSX -> PDF) Free API Configuration
# Configure ANY ONE of the free options below in Vercel Environment Variables.
# If none are configured, pdfpick automatically uses its built-in Zero-Key
# high-resolution browser rendering engine (PptxViewJS + HTML/Canvas PDF).
# ==============================================================================

# Option 1 (BEST - 100% Free & Unlimited, MIT/MPL-2.0 Commercial-Safe):
# Self-hosted Gotenberg with Korean fonts (see ./gotenberg/README.md)
# GOTENBERG_URL=https://your-gotenberg-service.onrender.com
# GOTENBERG_API_KEY=
# Optional: For 50MB+ direct browser uploads bypassing Vercel's 4.5MB limit (requires CORS header on proxy)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOTENBERG_URL=https://your-cors-gotenberg-url

# Option 2 (Managed Free API - 2,500 free conversions/month; review iLoveAPI ToS for public PDF tools):
# ILOVEPDF_PUBLIC_KEY=project_public_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# ILOVEPDF_SECRET_KEY=secret_key_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Option 3 (HIGHEST MS OFFICE FIDELITY - Daily free tier forever):
# Sign up free at https://cloudconvert.com/dashboard/api/v2/keys
# CLOUDCONVERT_API_KEY=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9...
